  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned how to apply combat techniques to energy weapons.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Any ability that would enable you ignore any amount damage reduction also enables you to ignore the same amount of energy resistance under the same circumstances (for example, you may use the Clustered Shots feat to cause fire resistance to only be applied on the first attack of a full attack with a laser rifle).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/starfinder-to-pathfinder#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
